---
description: Git workflow and change discipline
alwaysApply: true
---

# GIT

Use clean, reviewable commits.

Preferred pattern:

feat:
fix:
refactor:
test:
chore:
docs:

Examples:

feat: add board face management
fix: prevent overlapping face occupancy
test: add tenant isolation tests

---

# DO NOT

Do not:

force push
reset branches destructively
delete migrations
rewrite unrelated history
modify unrelated files

unless explicitly instructed.

Never commit `.env` files or service-role keys.

---

# BEFORE COMMIT

Run:

typecheck (`npx tsc --noEmit`)
lint (`npm run lint`)
tests

and where appropriate:

build (`npm run build`)

Do not commit known broken code.
